1. PURPOSE
----------
The Profit Aggregation Engine:
- collects revenue from all engines
- normalizes values
- reconciles ledger entries
- detects divergence
- computes total profit
- allocates 20% to Lux
- stores profit snapshots

2. LOCATION
-----------
/home/keshanth/ARKA/ardhanarishvara/profit/ProfitAggregationEngine.py

3. HOW IT WORKS
---------------
SupervisorCore logs engine results into the ledger.
ProfitAggregationEngine:
- loads ledger
- extracts revenue + cost
- computes profit
- allocates Lux share
- saves snapshot

4. SNAPSHOT FILE
----------------
/home/keshanth/ARKA/ardhanarishvara/profit/profit_snapshot.json

Contains:
- revenue
- cost
- profit
- Lux allocation
- engine breakdown
- timestamp

5. DIVERGENCE DETECTION
-----------------------
Flags:
- missing revenue fields
- malformed entries
- inconsistent engine reports

6. KERNEL DEPENDENCIES
----------------------
Uses:
- Ledger
- MathEngine
- LuxAllocator

7. AUTONOMY
-----------
This engine is required for:
- nightly reflection
- weekly audits
- financial autonomy
- Income AI cycle validation

